        "id": 1157738
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-04T09:00:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are correct. We should not require ownership to repopulate the buffer. It\u0027s empty, so it can\u0027t be mapped, owned or modified. The only other operation we might race is another repopulate, which we can synchronize on ctx-\u003elock. Will fix.",
      "parentUuid": "6c695ec1_a140f695",
      "revId": "f8e6614304809a47c3d09bc5c311414a783e602a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
