      "writtenOn": "2026-11-02T20:14:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we don\u0027t actually do anything with this value in `repopulate()` right now. Shouldn\u0027t we call `set_close_on_exec()` too?\n\nWhich brings me to another point: this has a lot of shared machinery with `publish_wrap()`. My concern with that is that we might make an update to one function and forget about the other. Should we try to centralize as much of this logic as we can?",
